Hero resource links, trimmed headline stats, drop the Listen section

- Remove the Listen / "Hear the contrast" section and its CSS. The audio
  demos were never filled in, so the placeholders came out.
- Author line is no longer bolded on the first author.
- Hero links become the resource row: Paper v1 (live), plus Paper v1.5,
  Code and Data marked "soon" as non-links with a dashed border, so a
  visitor cannot click something that is not there yet.
- Headline stats drop to three: 679 scenarios, 15 realtime systems
